{"id":"CVE-2013-0169","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2013-02-08T19:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T14:18:09.503Z","description":"The TLS protocol 1.1 and 1.2 and the DTLS protocol 1.0 and 1.2, as used in OpenSSL, OpenJDK, PolarSSL, and other products, do not properly consider timing side-channel attacks on a MAC check requirement during the processing of malformed CBC padding, which allows remote attackers to conduct distinguishing attacks and plaintext-recovery attacks via statistical analysis of timing data for crafted packets, aka the \"Lucky Thirteen\" issue.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/09/msg00029.html","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[debian-lts-announce] 20180925 [SECURITY] [DLA 1518-1] polarssl security update"},{"url":"http://www.matrixssl.org/news.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0587.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2013:0587"},{"url":"http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201406-32.xml","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_GENTOO"],"name":"GLSA-201406-32"},{"url":"http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2013-April/101366.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_FEDORA"],"name":"FEDORA-2013-4403"},{"url":"http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA13-051A.html","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_CERT"],"name":"TA13-051A"},{"url":"https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A19016","tags":["vdb-entry","signature","x_refsource_OVAL"],"name":"oval:org.mitre.oval:def:19016"},{"url":"http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:095","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_MANDRIVA"],"name":"MDVSA-2013:095"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/55139","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"