{"id":"CVE-2013-6450","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2014-01-01T15:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T17:39:01.167Z","description":"The DTLS retransmission implementation in OpenSSL 1.0.0 before 1.0.0l and 1.0.1 before 1.0.1f does not properly maintain data structures for digest and encryption contexts, which might allow man-in-the-middle attackers to trigger the use of a different context and cause a denial of service (application crash) by interfering with packet delivery, related to ssl/d1_both.c and ssl/t1_enc.c.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2014-01/msg00032.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2014:0049"},{"url":"http://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2014-0012.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031594","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1031594"},{"url":"http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=isg400001843","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1029549","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1029549"},{"url":"http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201412-39.xml","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_GENTOO"],"name":"GLSA-201412-39"},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2014/dsa-2833","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-2833"},{"url":"https://puppet.com/security/cve/cve-2013-6450","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://git.openssl.org/gitweb/?p=openssl.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=34628967f1e65dc8f34e000f0f5518e21afbfc7b","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/534161/100/0/threaded","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_BUGTRAQ"],"name":"20141205 NEW: VMSA-2014-0012 - VMware vSphere product updates address security vulnerabilities"},{"url":"http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/packag